      "cloudCover": 0.55,
      "why": "six region crossings in one run, at the same 150 m/s demo/crossing declares: 9000 m east over 3600 frames at 60 fps against a 1503 m region at 52.106 N. The yaw is held and the bearing IS the direction of travel, so the picture streams into world it has not seen and a frame distribution has one moving quantity in it instead of two.",
