      "cloudCover": 0.55,
      "why": "the moving capture a still cannot stand in for. It walks demo/ring's own path from its own start -- an eastM that begins anywhere else would teleport the eye past the loading phase's standpoint and photograph the ring catching up instead of a crossing -- at the same 150 m/s, far enough to pass the first region boundary at 940 m and the arrival of the leading regions behind it. Every frame is written, so a stand that appears between two of them is visible as one.",
